ich-text__text\">MENT CREATIVA</span> actua como Agencia de Eventos exclusivos. Tenemos la misi&oacute;n de crear momentos &uacute;nicos a trav&eacute;s de valores como la excelencia, presencia, seguridad, dinamismo y personalizaci&oacute;n. Las experiencias de nuestros clientes son nuestra meta y siempre llegamos mediante la incondicional pasi&oacute;n por nuestro trabajo y dando por supuesto que nada es imposible.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px; text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:20px;\">\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_39 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">EVENTOS CORPORATIVOS</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_39 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">EVENTOS PARTICULARES</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_39 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">EVENTOS TEM&Aacute;TICOS</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_39 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">PROTOCOLO</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_39 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">ORGANITZACI&Oacute;N DE BODAS</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"color_39 wixui-rich-text__text\">INCENTIVOS &amp; TEAM BUILDING ...</span></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-iofrpi961":{"width":5184,"height":3456,"uri":"32797a_35649c7ff9ef4850a744088e4fb1556a~mv1.jpg","title":"AUDIOVISUALES.jpg","containerId":"comp-iofrpi961","hasBgScrollEffect":"","bgEffectName":"","displayMode":"fill","link":{},"encoding":"AVIF","allowWebpAvifTransforms":true,"responsiveImageProps":{"fallbackSrc":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/32797a_35649c7ff9ef4850a744088e4fb1556a~mv1.jpg/v1/fill/w_291,h_170,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/32797a_35649c7ff9ef4850a744088e4fb1556a~mv1.jpg","srcset":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/32797a_35649c7ff9ef4850a744088e4fb1556a~mv1.jpg/v1/fill/w_291,h_170,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/32797a_35649c7ff9ef4850a744088e4fb1556a~mv1.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/32797a_35649c7ff9ef4850a744088e4fb1556a~mv1.jpg/v1/fill/w_582,h_340,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/32797a_35649c7ff9ef4850a744088e4fb1556a~mv1.jpg 2x","css":{"container":{"position":"relative"},"img":{"width":291,"height":170,"objectFit":"cover"}}},"containerWidth":291,"containerHeight":170,"isInFirstFold":false,"crop":null,"onClickBehavior":"goToLink","fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WPhoto","language":"es","compId":"comp-iofrpi961","mainPageId":"axdf2","trackClicksAnalytics":false,"popupA11yExperimentEnabled":false,"translations":{"expandAriaLabel":"Expandir imagen","zoomInButtonAriaLabel":"Zoom in"},"zoomedImageResponsiveOverride":{},"allowFullGIFTransformation":false},"comp-iofrpi962":{"html":"<h2 class=\"font_2 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:30px; line-height:0.9em; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;\" class=\"wixui-ri