CTORES</span></span></span></span></h2>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px; text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\">Generaci&oacute;n de contenidos como noticias, posts, art&iacute;culos de todo tipo, folletos publicitarios, eBooks, publirreportajes, dossiers ...</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\">Todo lo que un redactor puede escribir!</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px; text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:20px;\">\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px; text-align:justify;\"><span class=\"color_39 wixui-rich-text__text\">COPYS Y SLOGANS</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px; text-align:justify;\"><span class=\"color_39 wixui-rich-text__text\">GUIONES LITER&Aacute;RIOS</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_39 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">CONTENIDO WEB </span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_39 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">CONTENIDO PARA PRODUCTOS</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_39 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">REVISTAS Y FOLLETOS</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_39 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">TEXTOS</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_39 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">ANUNCIOS TV ...</span></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-ioh51yxv":{"width":764,"height":552,"uri":"32797a_108b3fbcbb674a01adc25a0871b196fa~mv1.jpg","title":"escuela-modelos.jpg","containerId":"comp-ioh51yxv","hasBgScrollEffect":"","bgEffectName":"","displayMode":"fill","link":{},"encoding":"AVIF","allowWebpAvifTransforms":true,"responsiveImageProps":{"fallbackSrc":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/32797a_108b3fbcbb674a01adc25a0871b196fa~mv1.jpg/v1/fill/w_291,h_170,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/32797a_108b3fbcbb674a01adc25a0871b196fa~mv1.jpg","srcset":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/32797a_108b3fbcbb674a01adc25a0871b196fa~mv1.jpg/v1/fill/w_291,h_170,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/32797a_108b3fbcbb674a01adc25a0871b196fa~mv1.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/32797a_108b3fbcbb674a01adc25a0871b196fa~mv1.jpg/v1/fill/w_582,h_340,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/32797a_108b3fbcbb674a01adc25a0871b196fa~mv1.jpg 2x","css":{"container":{"position":"relative"},"img":{"width":291,"height":170,"objectFit":"cover"}}},"containerWidth":291,"containerHeight":170,"isInFirstFold":false,"crop":null,"onClickBehavior":"goToLink","fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WPhoto","language":"es","compId":"comp-ioh51yxv","mainPageId":"axdf2","trackClicksAnalytics":false,"popupA11yExperimentEnabled":false,"translations":{"expandAriaLabel":"Expandir imagen","zoomInButtonAriaLabel":"Zoom in"},"zoomedImageResponsiveOverride":{},"allowFullGIFTransformation":false},"comp-ioh51yxv1":{"html":"<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:30px; text-align:center;\"><span class=\"color_39 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:jura,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">MODELOS Y AZAFATAS</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"text-align:justify; font-size:15px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px; text-align:justify;\"><span class=\"color_39 wixui-rich-text__text\">Ponemos a su disposici&oacute;n nuestro amplio archivo de azafatas que son seleccionadas seg&uacute;n el perfil de cada cliente y nuestros modelos le ofrecer&aacute;n a nuestros clientes imagen, elegancia y profesionalidad.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px; text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:20px;\">\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_39 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">CONGRESOS Y CONVENCIONES</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_39 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">FERIAS Y EXPOSICIONES</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_39 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">EVENTOS DEPORTIVOS</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_39 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">PROTOCOLO </span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_39 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">PRESENTACI&Oacute;N DE PRODUCTOS</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_39 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">PROMOTORES Y DEGUSTACIONES</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_39 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">REPARTO DE PUBLICIDAD </span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_39 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">PUBLICIDAD </span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_39 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">CASTINGS TV </span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_39 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">PASSARELA Y SHOWROOM&#39;S</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_39 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">CATALOGOS DE MODA ...</span></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"}}}},"nicknameToCompIdMaps":{}}